PN,31401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FAt least five survivors of sexual
OL,8,Fabuse at the hands of billionaire
OL,9,FHarrods owner Mohamed Al Fayed have
OL,10,Fbeen confirmed by the Home Office as
OL,11,Fvictims of human trafficking.
OL,13,FTheir experiences include both
OL,14,Finternational and domestic
OL,15,Ftrafficking, and even a case of
OL,16,Ftrafficking within the Harrods
OL,17,Fbuilding itself.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FOne survivor told the Press
OL,8,FAssociation they were recruited to a
OL,9,Ffalse role within Harrods, while two
OL,10,Fwere hired for a legitimate role and
OL,11,Fthen selected for abuse off the shop
OL,12,Ffloor.
OL,14,FAnother survivor was employed as a
OL,15,Fdomestic worker for a member of the
OL,16,FFayed family after being recruited via
OL,17,Fa letting agency called Hyde Park
OL,18,FResidence.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FTheir cases date back as early as the
OL,8,Fnineties, while the most recent took
OL,9,Fplace after the 2010 sale of Harrods.
OL,11,FAll five survivors have received
OL,12,Fconclusive grounds decisions from the
OL,13,FNational Referral Mechanism (NRM) that
OL,14,Fthey are victims of modern slavery,
OL,15,Fafter being referred by the charity
OL,16,FUnseen UK.
OL,18,FThe NRM is the UK's official framework
OL,19,Ffor identifying victims of modern
OL,20,Fslavery, including human trafficking,
OL,21,Fforced labour and servitude.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FThis reporting framework allows
OL,8,Fvictims to receive appropriate support
OL,9,Fand provides the Government with vital
OL,10,Fdata about modern slavery in the UK.
OL,12,FStatutory first responders, including
OL,13,Fthe police, Border Force, the National
OL,14,FCrime Agency and local authorities
OL,15,Fmust offer an NRM referral to any
OL,16,Fadult they have reasonable grounds to
OL,17,Fbelieve may be a victim of modern
OL,18,Fslavery.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FCertain non-governmental organisations
OL,8,F(NGOs) like Unseen, the Salvation
OL,9,FArmy, Bernardo's and the Refugee
OL,10,FCouncil are also able to make
OL,11,Freferrals as non-statutory first
OL,12,Fresponders.
OL,14,FOnce a potential victim is referred to
OL,15,Fthe NRM, the Single Competent
OL,16,FAuthority (SCA), which is part of the
OL,17,FHome Office, processes the referral
OL,18,Fand makes a decision on whether to
OL,19,Fofficially recognise the individual as
OL,20,Fa modern slavery victim.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FThe SCA first makes a decision as to
OL,8,Fwhether there are reasonable grounds
OL,9,Fto believe the person is a victim of
OL,10,Fmodern slavery and then, following an
OL,11,Finvestigation, returns a conclusive
OL,12,Fgrounds decision.
OL,14,FOn April 29 2026, it was reported by
OL,15,Fthe BBC that Rachel Louw had received
OL,16,Fa positive conclusive grounds
OL,17,Fdecision, after reporting abuse
OL,18,Fsuffered at the hands of Mohamed Al
OL,19,FFayed and his brother Salah.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FSince then, all four members of an
OL,8,Fadvocacy group for Al Fayed survivors
OL,9,Fcalled No One Above have also received
OL,10,Fconclusive grounds decisions that they
OL,11,Fare victims of modern slavery:
OL,12,FJustine, Elizabeth, Margo and
OL,13,FIsabella, all pseudonyms.
OL,15,FWhile these four have been confirmed
OL,16,Fby PA, it is understood that there are
OL,17,Fmore survivors who have also received
OL,18,Fpositive conclusive grounds decisions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FJustine worked at Harrods for more
OL,8,Fthan three years in the nineties, and
OL,9,Fwas trafficked and abused during this
OL,10,Ftime.
OL,12,FShe told PA she felt "shell shocked"
OL,13,Fwhen she received the conclusive
OL,14,Fgrounds decision in June that she had
OL,15,Fbeen a victim of modern slavery.
OL,26,@tD@VOUtD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FJustine said: "It's not something I
OL,8,Frealised was happening to me at the
OL,9,Ftime, so it's all part of this journey
OL,10,Fthat we're on now in reliving this
OL,11,Fexperience, and actually really
OL,12,Funderstanding what happened to us,
OL,13,Fwhich is very difficult."
OL,15,FShe added: "But it's a really
OL,16,Fsignificant thing, getting that
OL,17,Fdecision, seeing it in writing that
OL,18,Fyou were a victim of modern slavery
OL,19,Fand trafficking is very... it's really
OL,20,Fshocking to read."
OL,26,@oD@OOUuD@YO]wD@LOU|D@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FJustine told PA that this is "concrete
OL,8,Fconfirmation" from the Home Office
OL,9,Fthat Al Fayed survivors were victims
OL,10,Fof human trafficking and that the
OL,11,Fscope of experiences are wide: from
OL,12,Fdomestic to international trafficking,
OL,13,Ffrom those who worked at Harrods to
OL,14,Fthose not involved with Harrods at all.
OL,16,FShe said this is "very significant",
OL,17,Fbecause Harrods' position has been
OL,18,Fthat the abuse was just the actions of
OL,19,F"one bad man", and that there is
OL,20,Fnothing they can do now he is dead.
OL,26,@oD@^OUpD@MO]xD@ROUxD@cO]{D@AOU{D@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FJustine said: "These decisions
OL,8,Fillustrate that that is not the case
OL,9,Fat all."
OL,11,FElizabeth was also a Harrods employee
OL,12,Fand received a conclusive grounds
OL,13,Fdecision that she was a victim of
OL,14,Fmodern slavery in May.
OL,16,FShe told PA that all the survivors in
OL,17,Fthe Al Fayed case are victims of human
OL,18,Ftrafficking, because it was all one
OL,19,Fsystem that recruited, exploited and
OL,20,Fsilenced victims.
OL,26,@oD@OOUqD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/21
