PN,31412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FShe said: "Everybody connected with
OL,8,Fthis case is a trafficking victim,
OL,9,Fbecause it was all one system.
OL,11,F"You can't say that victim A wasn't
OL,12,Ftrafficked and victim B was.
OL,14,F"I think there's this persistent
OL,15,Fmisunderstanding, possibly within the
OL,16,FMetropolitan Police themselves, which
OL,17,Fis scary, that trafficking only
OL,18,Finvolves being moved across
OL,19,Finternational borders.
OL,26,@oD@KOUsD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/21
