CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,F"There have been positive conclusive
OL,8,Fgrounds trafficking decisions in cases
OL,9,Fwhere the trafficking occurred within
OL,10,Fthe Harrods building."
OL,12,FMargo was a domestic worker for the
OL,13,FFayed family after the sale of
OL,14,FHarrods, and was recruited via a
OL,15,Fletting agency called Hyde Park
OL,16,FResidence.
OL,18,FShe received a positive conclusive
OL,19,Fgrounds decision that she was a victim
OL,20,Fof human trafficking in July.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/21
