SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FMargo told PA that she had not felt
OL,8,Flike a victim of trafficking "because
OL,9,Freally I didn't know what trafficking
OL,10,Fwas, especially domestic trafficking".
OL,12,FShe said Al Fayed's trafficking
OL,13,Fnetwork went "so beyond Harrods".
OL,15,F"This was Balnagown, it was Saint-
OL,16,FTropez, it was Fayair, it was Fulham
OL,17,FFootball Club, it was Hyde Park
OL,18,FResidence.
OL,26,@pD@^OUrD@eO]uD@NOUuD@`O]wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/21
