OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31415
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,F"Everywhere he went he had enablers,
OL,8,Fand everywhere he went he had the
OL,9,Fcapacity to abuse. All of his
OL,10,Fresidences, all of his businesses,"
OL,11,Fshe added.
OL,13,FMargo said she did not originally come
OL,14,Fforward because she did not work at
OL,15,FHarrods.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@cO]
