FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31416
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FShe said: "There has just been so much
OL,8,Femphasis put on Harrods to the point
OL,9,Fwhere I believe that there are so many
OL,10,Fmore victims that haven't come forward
OL,11,Fbecause they believe that it's solely
OL,12,Fa Harrods issue.
OL,14,F"I know of one other Hyde Park
OL,15,FResidence victim, but there has to be
OL,16,Fhundreds more somewhere."
OL,26,@oD@KOUvD@AOUxD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/21
