OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31417
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FIsabella worked in the chairman's
OL,8,Foffice at Harrods in 2001. She
OL,9,Freceived her conclusive grounds
OL,10,Fdecision that she was a victim of
OL,11,Ftrafficking in May.
OL,13,FShe told PA: "I think one thing that
OL,14,Fthe public doesn't understand is they
OL,15,Fthink this was one bad man, but he
OL,16,Fcouldn't have done what he did without
OL,17,FHarrods processing women to him and
OL,18,Fsilencing them afterwards.
OL,26,@uD@NOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31418
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,F"And it wasn't just Harrods,
OL,8,Fobviously. It was any entity that Al
OL,9,FFayed owned or had control of.
OL,11,F"It was his yachts, his aviation
OL,12,Fbusiness, the Ritz Paris, his
OL,13,Fproperties all over France and Monaco,
OL,14,Fit went as far as the States and the
OL,15,FUAE ` anywhere that man touched."
OL,17,FIt was not just Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,18,Feither, she said, but "a wider network
OL,19,Fof perpetrators".
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUwD@aO]zD@WOU{D@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/21
