OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31419
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FIsabella added: "We are not aware of
OL,8,Fany negative decisions in this case,
OL,9,Fand there have now been many self-
OL,10,Finitiated referrals through Unseen."
OL,12,FMore than 400 allegations of sexual
OL,13,Fmisconduct have been made against Al
OL,14,FFayed, dating between 1977 and 2014,
OL,15,Fincluding sexual assault, rape, sexual
OL,16,Fexploitation and human trafficking.
OL,26,@oD@QOUrD@dO]
