PN,31420
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785779368
OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FThe Met Police are investigating at
OL,8,Fleast 156 victims who contacted them
OL,9,Fdirectly, including 21 who came
OL,10,Fforward before Al Fayed's death in
OL,11,F2023 at the age of 94.
OL,13,FThe investigation, known as Operation
OL,14,FCornpoppy, is looking at people who
OL,15,Fmay have facilitated or enabled Al
OL,16,FFayed's crimes.
OL,18,FFour people have been questioned to
OL,19,Fdate, 19 months after the
OL,20,Finvestigation opened.
