OL,3,CAt least five Mohamed Al Fayed
OL,4,Csurvivors confirmed as human
OL,5,Ctrafficking victims
OL,7,FA Home Office spokesperson said: "Our
OL,8,Fheartfelt condolences go out to all
OL,9,Fthose affected by this distressing
OL,10,Fcase. We are fully committed to
OL,11,Fsupporting victims and giving
OL,12,Fsurvivors the support and certainty
OL,13,Fthey need to recover.
OL,15,F"Our (violence against women and
OL,16,Fgirls) strategy sets out how the full
OL,17,Fpower of the state will be deployed to
OL,18,Fdeliver the largest ever crackdown on
OL,19,Fviolence against women and girls in
OL,20,FBritish history."
